                                                "sense_id": "6bd69da9-6504-381a-8e42-d97852cacfa6",
                                                "text": "Mrs Intiasar’s maids often masturbated her in the morning. It wasn’t something she discussed with anybody, least of all the maids. In fact, she hardly thought about it."
